@startuml
title System Architecture Diagram - Edge to Cloud Predictive Maintenance

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultFontColor #1F2937
skinparam packageBorderColor #374151
skinparam packageBackgroundColor #F9FAFB
skinparam componentBorderColor #374151
skinparam componentBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam nodeBorderColor #2563EB
skinparam nodeBackgroundColor #EFF6FF
skinparam databaseBorderColor #059669
skinparam databaseBackgroundColor #ECFDF5
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FEF3C7
skinparam noteBorderColor #D97706
skinparam arrowColor #374151

left to right direction

note as Purpose
  Purpose:
  Presents the full layered architecture from physical machines
  to sensors, ESP32 edge nodes, MQTT gateway, cloud processing,
  storage, alerting, and dashboard/reporting.
end note

package "1. Machine Layer" {
  node "Machine A" as MachineA
  node "Machine B" as MachineB
  node "Machine C" as MachineC
}

package "2. Sensor + Edge Layer" {
  component "Temperature\nSensor" as Temp
  component "Vibration\nSensor" as Vib
  node "ESP32 Sensor Node\nper machine" as ESP32 {
    component "Sensor Reading" as Read
    component "Timestamp + Machine ID" as Tag
    component "Optional Buffer" as Buffer
    component "MQTT Client" as Client
  }
}

package "3. Communication Layer" {
  cloud "Wi-Fi Network" as Wifi
  node "Gateway /\nMQTT Broker" as Broker
}

package "4. Cloud / Processing Layer" {
  component "Ingestion Service" as Ingest
  component "Preprocessing" as Preprocess
  component "Feature Extraction\nRMS, mean, peaks" as Feature
  component "Health Analysis\nrules / ML model" as Model
  component "Alert Service" as Alert
}

package "5. Storage + Application Layer" {
  database "Telemetry History" as TelemetryDB
  database "Alert + Maintenance\nRecords" as AlertDB
  component "Dashboard / Report" as UI
}

MachineA --> Temp : heat
MachineA --> Vib : vibration
MachineB ..> ESP32 : same repeated node pattern
MachineC ..> ESP32 : same repeated node pattern
Temp --> Read : local wired input
Vib --> Read : local wired input
Read --> Tag : raw reading
Tag --> Buffer : tagged record
Buffer --> Client : publish queue
Client --> Wifi : MQTT over Wi-Fi
Wifi --> Broker : telemetry topic
Broker --> Ingest : subscribed stream
Ingest --> TelemetryDB : raw / tagged records
Ingest --> Preprocess : clean data
Preprocess --> Feature : features
Feature --> Model : feature vector
Model --> Alert : health state + risk score
Model --> TelemetryDB : processed results
Alert --> AlertDB : alert event
Alert --> Broker : machine-specific alert topic
Broker --> Wifi : downstream alert
Wifi --> Client : subscribed alert
TelemetryDB --> UI : trends + KPIs
AlertDB --> UI : alert history

legend bottom
|= Layer / Symbol |= Meaning |
| Machine Layer | Physical assets: motors, pumps, fans, compressors, conveyors |
| Sensor + Edge Layer | Local ESP32 node reads wired sensors and tags records |
| Communication Layer | MQTT over Wi-Fi carries telemetry and alert topics |
| Cloud / Processing Layer | Cleans data, extracts features, predicts health, creates alerts |
| Storage + Application Layer | Stores history and presents dashboard/report outputs |
| Dashed arrows | Repeated pattern for additional machines |
endlegend
@enduml
